// Tier 3. The reward for the whole ladder.
//
// max_stack and durability are tuning, not structure: change them here,
// no recompile (REQUIREMENTS.md #3). An item declaring durability must
// declare max_stack: 1 -- the registry rejects the combination, because
// ItemStack's invariant makes a stack of two worn tools unbuildable.
ItemDef(
    name:       "cubara:iron_pick",
    max_stack:  1,
    durability: Some(400),
    // 0 hand, 1 wood, 2 stone, 3 iron (PHASE2_ARCHITECTURE.md 4).
    tier:       3,
    // Blocks break in ceil(hardness / speed) ticks; the empty hand is 1.
    speed:      Some(6),
    // A real trip's worth of work: 30 minutes on the floor, not 5
    // (PHASE2_ARCHITECTURE.md 10.5).
    rarity:     Uncommon,
)
